替换原因：

1. utility-types 远不如 type-fest 流行, type-fest 周下载量 1,123,860,311， utility-types: 3,391,137 差 70 倍
2. 很多实用类型 utility-types 没有多，type-fest 大而全


例如：

UnitonToTuple:

```ts
export enum FileSource {
  ImageGeneration = 'image_generation',
}
const fileSourceValues = Object.values(FileSource) as UnionToTuple<`${FileSource}`>;
```

[JsonValue](https://github.com/sindresorhus/type-fest/blob/main/source/JsonValue.d.ts) 替代 any 声明可以 json 序列化的类型。

[Simplify](https://github.com/sindresorhus/type-fest/blob/main/source/jsonifiable.d.ts) 拍平类型：

```ts
type PositionProps = {
	top: number;
	left: number;
};

type SizeProps = {
	width: number;
	height: number;
};

// In your editor, hovering over `Props` will show a flattened object with all the properties.
type Props = Simplify<PositionProps & SizeProps>;
```

LiteralUnion:

```ts
// Before

type Pet = 'dog' | 'cat' | string;

const pet: Pet = '';
// Start typing in your TypeScript-enabled IDE.
// You **will not** get auto-completion for `dog` and `cat` literals.

// After

type Pet2 = LiteralUnion<'dog' | 'cat', string>;

const pet: Pet2 = '';
// You **will** get auto-completion for `dog` and `cat` literals.
```

Promisable, ValueOf 等等，很多实用的类型 utility-types 没有


